 "dialogues": {
  "14347_9550": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9550",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9550.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9550.flac",
    "dur": 18.4,
    "cps": 17.7,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 1038417918,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.017,
     "cps": 17.7,
     "secs": 18.4,
     "sim": 0.754
    },
    "text": "Le calice de renaissance doit être renforcé d'élémentium. Je ne connais qu'une seule source de ce minerai : les plans élémentaires, au cœur de notre monde.\n\nIl y a quelqu'un que vous pouvez consulter, un Sculpte-terre, qui en sait sans doute plus que moi sur l'acquisition d'un tel objet. Vous devez trouver ce Sculpte-terre !",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T05:12:52"
   }
  },
  "14347_9253": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9253",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9253.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9253.flac",
    "dur": 3.8,
    "cps": 17.7,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 488218759,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0006,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.7,
     "secs": 3.8,
     "sim": 0.715
    },
    "text": "Contemplez ce champ ravagé et méditez sur la puissance des éléments!",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-13T02:50:10"
   }
  },
  "14347_9297": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9297",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9297.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9297.flac",
    "dur": 3.8,
    "cps": 15.7,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 58133655,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0013,
     "fr": 0.9971,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.7,
     "secs": 3.8,
     "sim": 0.755
    },
    "text": "Je sais bien des choses. Écoutez et faites votre éducation.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:17:38"
   }
  },
  "14347_9299": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9299",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9299.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9299.flac",
    "dur": 17.1,
    "cps": 17.8,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 1788437781,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0008,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.8,
     "secs": 17.1,
     "sim": 0.774
    },
    "text": "Dans un temps d’avant le temps, que les usurpateurs appelleront plus tard le Premier Âge de la Création, mon maître et les siens régnaient sur ce monde. Ce sont eux, les Dieux très anciens, qui ont tout créé.\n\nEt ce sont eux qui, plus tard, ont été rejetés par ceux qui osent se parer du nom de Formeurs.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T05:44:05"
   }
  },
  "14347_9301": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9301",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9301.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9301.flac",
    "dur": 20.9,
    "cps": 19.0,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 2001121299,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0009,
     "fr": 0.998,
     "wer": 0.071,
     "cps": 19.0,
     "secs": 20.9,
     "sim": 0.786
    },
    "text": "Leurs formes visibles étaient affaiblies par des éternités de combats. Ils étaient emprisonnés sous le monde, ce monde qu’ils avaient eux-mêmes créé. La corruption des Titans Formeurs a pénétré sous la surface et souillé les Dieux très anciens.\n\nC’est alors, en ce lieu, que les frères se sont retournés les uns contre les autres. Pendant cinq mille ans, une bataille a fait rage au cœur du monde.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T05:20:09"
   }
  },
  "14347_9331": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9331",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9331.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9331.flac",
    "dur": 16.7,
    "cps": 17.1,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 16445248,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.042,
     "cps": 17.1,
     "secs": 16.7,
     "sim": 0.768
    },
    "text": "C’est durant la Fracture élémentaire que le seigneur du Feu, Ragnaros, a tenté de consumer mon seigneur, Thunderaan, prince de l’Air.\n\nDemitrian s’incline, son visage tordu par la rage.\n\nPrononcez son nom et je décorerai ce camp ravagé avec vos entrailles. Restez silencieux et écoutez.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:17:41"
   }
  },
  "14347_9333": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9333",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9333.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9333.flac",
    "dur": 6.5,
    "cps": 20.1,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 636277351,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.043,
     "cps": 20.1,
     "secs": 6.5,
     "sim": 0.671
    },
    "text": "Ce sont les lieutenants de Ragnaros, Geddon et Garr, qui ont été les instruments de la trahison. Thunderaan ne se doutait de rien.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-12T14:43:53",
    "refused": {
     "by": "judge",
     "at": "2026-10-12T14:43:53",
     "failed": [
      "sim"
     ]
    }
   }
  },
  "14347_9335": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9335",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9335.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9335.flac",
    "dur": 18.6,
    "cps": 17.6,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 588669607,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0001,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.121,
     "cps": 17.6,
     "secs": 18.6,
     "sim": 0.791
    },
    "text": "L’avancée du seigneur du Feu était passée inaperçue de Thunderaan. Avant que mon seigneur ne puisse réagir, Sulfuras, le marteau légendaire de Ragnaros, a frappé un coup fatal. Thunderaan est tombé, à jamais vaincu.\n\nLe seigneur du Feu s’est repu de l’essence de mon seigneur, mais il n’est pas parvenu à le dévorer entièrement.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T05:20:17"
   }
  },
  "14347_9337": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9337",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9337.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9337.flac",
    "dur": 10.2,
    "cps": 18.6,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 374310119,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.6,
     "secs": 10.2,
     "sim": 0.686
    },
    "text": "Le peu qui restait de l’essence de Thunderaan fut conservé dans un talisman de lien élémentaire. Ragnaros a brisé ce talisman en deux morceaux parfaits, qui furent donnés à ses lieutenants…",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-13T22:01:36",
    "refused": {
     "by": "judge",
     "at": "2026-10-13T22:01:36",
     "failed": [
      "sim"
     ]
    }
   }
  },
  "14347_9546": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9546",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9546.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9546.flac",
    "dur": 9.7,
    "cps": 16.2,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 591036260,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0007,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.2,
     "secs": 9.7,
     "sim": 0.764
    },
    "text": "Vous avez retrouvé la prison éternelle de mon maître !\n\nOh, cela fait si longtemps que j'attends ce jour, et finalement, il s'accomplit.\n\nIl faut le libérer !",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T05:44:13"
   }
  },
  "14347_9548": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9548",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9548.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9548.flac",
    "dur": 8.9,
    "cps": 19.3,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 986246256,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 19.3,
     "secs": 8.9,
     "sim": 0.689
    },
    "text": "Je détiens le calice de la renaissance. Si vous envisagez d'entreprendre cette tâche, vous devrez renforcer le calice et, au final, briser l'emprise de Ragnaros lui-même !",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T05:27:42",
    "refused": {
     "by": "judge",
     "at": "2026-10-11T05:27:42",
     "failed": [
      "sim"
     ]
    }
   }
  },
  "14347_9553": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9553",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9553.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/miscellaneous/legendary/14347/dialogue_9553.flac",
    "dur": 12.2,
    "cps": 17.6,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 1057932636,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.998,
     "wer": 0.027,
     "cps": 17.6,
     "secs": 12.2,
     "sim": 0.756
    },
    "text": "La forme physique de Ragnaros doit être détruite. Son essence surgira alors de ses restes. Dans cet état affaibli, l'emprise de Ragnaros sur la prison de Thunderaan se relâchera. L'essence elle-même servira de clé...",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q300380850",
     "voice_seed": 300380850
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T05:33:15"
   }
  },
  "14347_9573": {
   "npc": 14347,
   "page": "9573",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14347\\dialogue_9573.ogg",
